"en": "give full", "tr": "tam verin", "fr": "donnez pleine mesure", "id": "penuhilah", "ur": "پورا دو", "bn": "পূর্ণ করে দাও", "fa": "تمام و کامل بدهید"}}, {"text": "ٱلْكَيْلَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَكُونُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمُخْسِرِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "13:20", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1727.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Such as keep the pact of Allah, and break not the covenant;", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlar ki, Allah'ın ahdini yerine getirirler ve antlaşmayı bozmazlar.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "وہ جو اللہ کا عہد پورا کرتے ہیں اور قول باندھ کر پھرتے نہیں", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(yaitu) orang-orang yang memenuhi janji Allah dan tidak merusak perjanjian,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُوفُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/d081dce5d71647eef6cc.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "ispunjavaju", "en": "they fulfil", "tr": "yerine getirirler", "fr": "ils remplissent", "id": "mereka menepati", "ur": "وہ پورا کرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা পূর্ণ করে", "fa": "وفا می‌کنند"}}, {"text": "بِعَهْدِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَنقُضُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمِيثَٰقَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "3:76", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/369.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Nay, but (the chosen of Allah is) he who fulfilleth his pledge and wardeth off (evil); for lo! Allah loveth those who ward off (evil).", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Hayır, kim sözünü yerine getirir ve kötülüklerden korunursa, şüphesiz Allah da korunanları sever.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "ہاں کیوں نہیں جس نے اپنا عہد پورا کیا اور پرہیزگاری کی اور بیشک پرہیزگار اللہ کو خوش آتے ہیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(Bukan demikian), sebenarnya siapa yang menepati janji (yang dibuat)nya dan bertakwa, maka sesungguhnya Allah menyukai orang-orang yang bertakwa.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "بَلَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَوْفَىٰ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/c47739b735eaaa01d439.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "ispuni", "en": "fulfils", "tr": "yerine getirir", "fr": "remplit", "id": "menepati", "ur": "وہ پورا کرتا ہے", "bn": "পূর্ণ করে", "fa": "وفا می‌کند"}}, {"text": "بِعَهْدِهِۦ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱتَّقَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَإِنَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُحِبُّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "وَأَوْفُوا۟", "count": 5, "first": "2:40", "audio": "audio/f0f13ca350981d8fa69b.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "and (you all) fulfil!", "bs": "i ispunite!", "tr": "ve yerine getirin!", "fr": "et accomplissez !", "id": "dan penuhilah!", "ur": "